msgstr "语音通话"

#: addon\globalPlugins\remotePlusPlus\interface.py:138
msgid ""
"Audio uses Opus at 48 kHz. Lower bitrate uses less bandwidth. Balanced mode "
"reduces packet overhead but adds delay. More buffering can reduce "
"interruptions but delays playback; minimum buffering does not mean zero "
"latency. Apply changes to restart active listening; audio stays off if it is "
"not already enabled."
msgstr ""
"音频采用 48 kHz Opus 编码。降低比特率可减少带宽占用。均衡模式可减少数据包开"
"销，但会增加延迟。增加缓冲可减少断续，但会延后播放；最小缓冲不代表零延迟。应"
"用更改会重启正在收听的音频；未开启音频时只保存设置。"

#. Translators: Settings could not be saved; the current audio continues unchanged.
#: addon\globalPlugins\remotePlusPlus\interface.py:167
msgid "Unable to save audio settings. The previous settings are still in use."
msgstr "无法保存音频设置，仍使用此前的设置。"

