msgid "Enhances NVDA Remote with productivity features for power users."
msgstr "增强 NVDA 远程访问功能，为高级用户提供更高效的操作体验。"

#. Brief changelog for this version
#. Translators: what's new content for the add-on version to be shown in the add-on store
#: buildVars.py:28
msgid ""
"## 1.0.0\n"
"\n"
"- Raise the minimum supported NVDA version to 2026.1.\n"
"- Add low-latency audio relay for listening to the controlled computer's "
"system sounds and making bidirectional voice calls. This requires "
"[NVDARemoteAudioServer](https://github.com/haitun001/NVDARemoteAudioServer) "
"to be deployed on the host running the Remote Access server with TCP and UDP "
"port 6838 exposed; Remote++ reuses the server address and key from the "
"current Remote connection.\n"
"- Add separate playback buffer, bitrate, channel, and transmission mode "
"settings for system audio and voice calls in NVDA Settings → Remote++.\n"
"- Add \"Listen to remote system sounds\" and \"Voice call\" to the Remote "
"Access menu.\n"
"- Make \"Listen to remote system sounds\" and \"Voice call\" available for "
"assignment in NVDA's Input Gestures dialog. No gestures are assigned by "
"default.\n"
"- Add configurable gestures for moving to the previous or next saved "
"connection without opening the Connection Manager. The target connection "
"name is announced before connecting. No gestures are assigned by default.\n"
"- Pause the controlled computer's normal NVDA Remote speech feedback while "
"remote system sound listening is enabled to avoid duplicate speech.\n"
"- Require an audio-capable Remote++ version on both computers; older "
"versions continue to support normal Remote control.\n"
"- Add Turkish translation.\n"
msgstr ""
"## 1.0.0\n"
"\n"
"- 将支持的最低 NVDA 版本提升至 2026.1。\n"
"- 新增低延迟音频传输，可收听被控计算机的系统声音并进行双向语音通话。需要在运"
"行 Remote Access 服务端的主机上部署 [NVDARemoteAudioServer](https://"
"github.com/haitun001/NVDARemoteAudioServer)，并开放 TCP 和 UDP 6838 端口；"
"Remote++ 会复用当前 Remote 连接的服务器地址和密钥。\n"
"- 在 NVDA 设置 → Remote++ 中，为系统声音和语音通话分别提供播放缓冲、比特率、"
"声道及传输模式设置。\n"
"- 在 Remote Access 菜单中新增“收听远程系统声音”和“语音通话”。\n"
"- “收听远程系统声音”和“语音通话”现在可以在 NVDA 的“输入手势”对话框中分配，默认不分配手势。\n"
"- 新增向前或向后切换已保存连接的可配置手势，无需打开连接管理器即可快速切换；连接前会播报目标连接名称，默认不分配手势。\n"
"- 开启收听远程系统声音时，暂停被控计算机的 NVDA Remote 常规语音反馈，以避免重"
"复朗读。\n"
"- 两台计算机都需要使用支持音频的 Remote++ 版本；旧版本仍支持常规远程控制。\n"
"- 新增土耳其语翻译。\n"

